<section id="A0.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection"><span id="A0.SS1.6" class="ltx_text">-A</span> </span><span id="A0.SS1.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Experiment Details</span></h3>

<div id="A0.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A0.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A0.SS1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Dynamics:</span> For planar quadrotor examples, we used the parameters <math id="A0.SS1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="m=0.5kg" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>0.5</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>k</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>g</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m=0.5kg</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A0.SS1.p1.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="g=-9.81m/s^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo rspace="0em">=</mo><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><mn>9.81</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>/</mo><mi>s</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">g=-9.81m/s^{2}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A0.SS1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="I_{y}=0.01kg\cdot m^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>0.01</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>k</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>g</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">I_{y}=0.01kg\cdot m^{2}</annotation></semantics></math> for the dynamics model</p>
