x_{6}\\
-\frac{u_{1}}{m}\sin(x_{3})\\
g+\frac{u_{1}}{m}\cos(x_{3})\\
\frac{u_{2}}{I_{y}}\end{bmatrix}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
