<span id="A0.SS1.p5.pic1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A0.SS1.p5.pic1.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A0.SS1.p5.pic1.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Task Definition:</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A0.SS1.p5.pic1.p7" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A0.I2" class="ltx_itemize">
<span id="A0.I2.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A0.I2.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A0.I2.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A0.I2.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Start Point (Green Dot): [current start]</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A0.I2.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A0.I2.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A0.I2.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A0.I2.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Goal Point (Red Dot): [goal]</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A0.I2.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A0.I2.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A0.I2.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A0.I2.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Waypoints: Your goal is to find the most efficient and direct path possible.</span></span>
<span id="A0.I2.i3.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<span id="A0.I2.i3.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A0.I2.i3.I1.i1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<span id="A0.I2.i3.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A0.I2.i3.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A0.I2.i3.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Actively look for and utilize safe passages or gaps between obstacles.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A0.I2.i3.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A0.I2.i3.I1.i2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<span id="A0.I2.i3.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A0.I2.i3.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A0.I2.i3.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">The path should be smooth and avoid abrupt bends. The waypoints you provide will be linearly interpolated.</span></span>
</span></span>
</span>
</span></span>
</span>
</span>
<span id="A0.SS1.p5.pic1.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A0.SS1.p5.pic1.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A0.SS1.p5.pic1.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Safety Constraints:</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A0.SS1.p5.pic1.p8" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A0.I3" class="ltx_itemize">
<span id="A0.I3.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A0.I3.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A0.I3.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A0.I3.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">All food and drink items in the image are obstacles that the robot must avoid.</span></span>
</span></span>
</span>
</span>
<span id="A0.SS1.p5.pic1.p4" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A0.SS1.p5.pic1.p4.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A0.SS1.p5.pic1.p4.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Required Output Format:</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A0.SS1.p5.pic1.p9" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A0.I4" class="ltx_itemize">
<span id="A0.I4.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A0.I4.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A0.I4.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A0.I4.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Your entire response MUST be a single JSON object and nothing else. Do NOT include any explanatory text, greetings, apologies, or markdown formatting like </span><span id="A0.I4.i1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">‘‘‘json</span><span id="A0.I4.i1.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">.</span></span>
</span></span>
</span>
</span></span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
